@@ -0,0 +1,501 @@
+;******************************************************************************
+;* MMX/SSE2-optimized functions for the RV40 decoder
+;* Copyright (c) 2010 Ronald S. Bultje <rsbultje@gmail.com>
+;* Copyright (c) 2010 Fiona Glaser <fiona@x264.com>
