+;******************************************************************************
+;* x86-SIMD-optimized IDCT for prores
+;* this is identical to "simple" IDCT written by Michael Niedermayer
+;* except for the clip range
+;*
+;* Copyright (c) 2011 Ronald S. Bultje <rsbultje@gmail.com>
